 "offset_seconds": -4.180000000000167,
 "words_heard": 216,
 "words": 216,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "They came to me with open hands and said we've seen the Lord",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I shook my head and turned away, I would not take their word",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Unless I see the mark of nails and touch them with my hand",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 1.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Unless I touch his wounded side, I cannot understand",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.96,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Eight days later we were gathered and the doors were locked again",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 1.05,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He came and stood among us and he spoke to all of them",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Peace be with you, said the Master, and he turned his eyes to me",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 1.07,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He did not scold, he did not shame, he showed his hands to me",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Put your finger here",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Look at my hands",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 1.02,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Reach out your hand and put it into my side",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Stop doubting and believe",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "My Lord and my God",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "My Lord and my God",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Blessed are those who have not seen and yet have believed",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We never saw the empty tomb, we never touched his hand",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.96,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But the word has come to us across the sea and land",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 1.03,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So we are in the blessing that he spoke inside that room",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.96,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For those who have not seen him risen from the tomb",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.99,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "My Lord and my God",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
